{'symbol': 'PKI', 'date': '2021-07-26 06:31:00', 'title': 'PERKINELMER ANNOUNCES FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021', 'text': 'WALTHAM, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PERKINELMER, INC. (NYSE: PKI), A GLOBAL LEADER COMMITTED TO INNOVATING FOR A HEALTHIER WORLD, TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE SECOND QUARTER ENDED JULY 4, 2021. THE COMPANY REPORTED GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS OF $2.19, AS COMPARED TO GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS OF $1.23 IN THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2020. GAAP REVENUE FOR THE QUARTER WAS $1.228 BILLION, AS COMPARED TO $812 MILLION IN THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2020.'}{'symbol': 'PKI', 'date': '2021-07-26 06:30:00', 'title': 'PERKINELMER TO ACQUIRE ANTIBODY AND REAGENT LEADER BIOLEGEND', 'text': 'WALTHAM, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PERKINELMER HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE BIOLEGEND, A LEADING, GLOBAL PROVIDER OF LIFE SCIENCE ANTIBODIES AND REAGENTS.'}